  exactMappings:
  - 'startSize  <- minSize/maxSize: 0.03..0.05'
  - 'startLifetime <- minEnergy/maxEnergy: 3..6'
  - startRotation <- rndRotation=False (0..360deg random when true)
  - simulationSpace <- 'Simulate in Worldspace?'=False
  - scalingMode=Shape (legacy did not scale particle size with transform scale)
  - playOnAwake <- m_Emit=True
  - velocityOverLifetime space = Local
  - 'localVelocity contribution: (0, 0, 0)'
  - 'worldVelocity contribution: (0, 0, 0)'
  - 'rndVelocity: (0, 0, 0) (as +/- envelope)'
  - shape -> Sphere radius 0.12 scale (1, 1, 1)
  - colorAnimation 5 keys -> ColorOverLifetime gradient (keys at 0/25/50/75/100%)
  - 'damping=1: documented legacy semantics is NO damping (velocity held constant
    until the particle dies). VOLT left constant - exact.'
  - renderMode Billboard
  - 'renderer copy: material/shadows/probes/sorting/cameraVelocityScale/lengthScale/velocityScale/maxParticleSize'
  - 'NOTE: ''exact'' classifications are static-analysis only - every mapping still
    requires visual verification in-engine.'
  approximations:
  - 'emission rate: legacy re-rolls min..max per emission event; Shuriken min/max
    rate sampling interval differs - verify perceived grain at low rates (1..4/s)'
  - legacy adds the velocity contributions at SPAWN; Shuriken VelocityOverLifetime
    applies them over the whole particle life. For constant-velocity contributions
    this phase coincides; combined with the damping curve this should reproduce legacy
    motion - VERIFY per emitter.
  - 'tangentVelocity=(0.12, 0.12, 0.12): legacy computes a per-particle tangent to
    the ellipsoid surface at the spawn point (a swirl). Shuriken 2017.4 has no tangential
    mode; V2 uses +/- per-axis VelocityOverLifetime envelope. Trajectory distribution
    differs - VERIFY (worst on ''Cloud''/''Cloud_bad'' systems).'
  unsupported:
  - emitterVelocityScale=0.12 is documented as inert unless 'Simulate in Worldspace?'
    is enabled; this system simulates local, so legacy applies no emitter-velocity
    inheritance - nothing converted (V1 mapped it unconditionally and wrongly).
  - 'rotation axes localRotationAxis=(0.2, 0.2, 0.2) worldRotationAxis=(0, 0, 0):
    Shuriken RotationOverLifetime is Z-magnitude only; Z-approximation was used -
    VERIFY orientation.'
  warnings:
  - Legacy components were preserved (not modified, not disabled, not deleted). Delete
    the [PSV2] child to revert.
  - Runtime code that searches GetComponentsInChildren<ParticleSystem> under this
    hierarchy will now also see the converted system.
  - Runtime scripts that disable legacy ParticleRenderer (e.g. Arrow.cs) will NOT
    hide the converted system until the cutover stage.
  - 'NOTE: legacy runtime toggling of m_Emit after startup has no automatic Shuriken
    equivalent; verify no script relies on it for [PSV2] Cloud'
  - 'holder local/world scale is not (1,1,1): converted value ranges were computed
    from world/local directions and should be re-verified after any parent scale change.'
